n":"删除产品中的任何原始内容输入路径。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["EPH_5_11_12"],"summary":"恢复工具不需要收集、重放或分享色情材料。","title":"不保存、不转发刺激内容"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"MEDIA","full_practice":"调整推荐、通知和设备权限，不进行秘密监控。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"sexual-media.recommendation-reset","minimum_action":"移除一个高触发来源。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["MATT_5_29_30"],"summary":"通过取消关注、历史清理和内容偏好降低触发。","title":"重置推荐环境"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"MEDIA","full_practice":"讨论产业、同意、剥削和现实关系成本，避免图像细节。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"sexual-media.reality-and-dignity","minimum_action":"用“具有尊严的人”替换物化语言。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["GEN_1_27"],"summary":"拒绝把人降为刺激、对象和商品。","title":"看见屏幕后的人"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"MARRIAGE","full_practice":"聚焦事实类别、影响、责任、边界和专业支持。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"marriage.honest-nonexplicit-conversation","minimum_action":"约定一次非细节化对话。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["EPH_4_15_32"],"summary":"诚实需要尊重配偶安全，不以刺激性细节造成二次伤害。","title":"婚姻中的诚实而非细节倾倒"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"SINGLENESS","full_practice":"建设友谊、教会、工作、身体和使命的整全生活。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"singleness.whole-person-community","minimum_action":"参与一次真实群体或服事。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["1COR_7_32_35"],"summary":"单身不等于等待成为完整的人。","title":"单身中的整全归属"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"AGE_GATE","full_practice":"移除隐私诱导，改为场景化、可跳过问题。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"agegate.ask-no-sexual-history","minimum_action":"检查表单是否要求个人性史。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["MARK_9_42"],"summary":"课程只提供年龄适切的身体、边界、媒体和求助教育。","title":"不向未成年人索取性史"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"AGE_GATE","full_practice":"提供可见的求助、监护与组织政策说明。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"agegate.no-private-minor-chat","minimum_action":"禁用 privateMinorChat。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["MATT_18_5_6"],"summary":"保护透明度和可信成人参与。","title":"未成年人不得进入秘密AI亲密聊天"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"SAFETY","full_practice":"按既有S2/S3政策最小化记录并人工处理。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"safety.coercion-stop-and-tell","minimum_action":"停止普通课程，选择可信成人或保护渠道。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PS_82_3_4"],"summary":"强迫、威胁、勒索、成人与未成年人不当接触需要保护流程。","title":"强迫或剥削：停止并求助"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"SAFETY","full_practice":"引导保存必要法律证据的本地专业建议，而不是上传产品。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"safety.nonconsensual-imagery","minimum_action":"记录类别而不记录材料。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_31_8_9"],"summary":"不要求上传、查看或证明影像内容。","title":"未经同意影像安全门"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"INTEGRATION","full_practice":"形成7/14/30/90天计划并设复盘点。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"integration.rule-of-life","minimum_action":"选择三条规则。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["ROM_13_13_14"],"summary":"把身份、欲望、设备、支持和关系责任整合。","title":"整合为可执行生活规则"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"INTEGRATION","full_practice":"记录一个保留、一个改变、一个求助。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"integration.grace-and-truth-review","minimum_action":"回答：真理要求什么？恩典怎样让我回来？","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["JOHN_1_14_17"],"summary":"既不纵容也不以羞耻驱动。","title":"恩典与真理复盘"}],"review_status":"theology_review","version":"1.0.0"}'::jsonb,'[{"source":"batch_04/assets/identity-intimacy-practice-catalog.seed.ya