":"到期后恢复规则或正式修改。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.exception.expire","minimum_action":"给例外添加结束时间。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["ECCL_3_1"],"summary":"避免临时例外成为秘密后门。","title":"例外自动到期"},{"age_bands":["parent","elementary","younger_teen","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"REPAIR","full_practice":"再讨论影响和责任。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.conflict.facts-first","minimum_action":"各方只陈述可验证事实。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_18_17"],"summary":"区分事实、解释、感受和规则。","title":"冲突先分清事实"},{"age_bands":["parent"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"REPAIR","full_practice":"选择相称后果、修复和恢复路径。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.conflict.repair-not-shame","minimum_action":"删除一个羞辱性标签。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["GAL_6_1"],"summary":"违规需要后果，但不需要人格羞辱。","title":"修复而非公开羞辱"},{"age_bands":["parent"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"REPAIR","full_practice":"修正规则或解释真实角色差异。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.conflict.parent-inconsistency","minimum_action":"父母说出一项不一致。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["MATT_7_3_5"],"summary":"规则变化或成人双标需要被承认。","title":"父母不一致也要认错"},{"age_bands":["parent"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"SABBATH","full_practice":"避免安息期间因未准备而反复破界。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.sabbath.prepare","minimum_action":"完成三项预备。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["EXOD_16_22_30"],"summary":"提前处理联系人、路线、音乐和紧急方式。","title":"数字安息前预备"},{"age_bands":["parent","elementary","younger_teen","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"SABBATH","full_practice":"让成员轮流提出活动。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.sabbath.replace","minimum_action":"选择两项替代活动。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PS_16_11"],"summary":"拿走设备后要有敬拜、关系、自然和创造。","title":"用更厚的生活替代屏幕"},{"age_bands":["parent"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"SABBATH","full_practice":"讨论安息带来的困难和礼物。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.sabbath.reentry","minimum_action":"关闭一个不必要通知。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["HEB_4_9_11"],"summary":"观察哪些通知和内容值得重新打开。","title":"安息后的重新进入"},{"age_bands":["parent"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"REVIEW","full_practice":"保留、修改、暂停或求助。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.review.no-score","minimum_action":"选择一个有效和一个摩擦条款。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["LAM_3_40"],"summary":"家庭不是排行榜。","title":"复盘条款，不评家庭分"},{"age_bands":["parent"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"REVIEW","full_practice":"防止报复并说明安全边界。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.review.member-safety","minimum_action":"给孩子一个可跳过的表达渠道。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PS_82_3"],"summary":"复盘要注意权力差异。","title":"弱小成员可以说困难"},{"age_bands":["parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"SAFETY","full_practice":"由授权人最小化记录并行动。","guardrails":["不得只用没收设备替代保护和专业求助"],"id":"family.safety.stop-ordinary-flow","minimum_action":"进入S2/S3安全门。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_24_11"],"summary":"勒索、成人不当接触、自伤或即时危险不是普通设备冲突。","title":"出现保护风险时停止普通规则讨论"},{"age_bands":["parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"SAFETY","full_practice":"根据当地专业建议在安全渠道处理证据。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.safety.no-evidence-upload","minimum_action":"只记录 concernCategory。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_31_8_9"],"summary":"产品不做取证仓库。","title":"不把敏感证据上传课程系统"},{"age_bands":["parent","elementary","younger_teen","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"INTEGRATION","full_practice":"保存版本、签署角色和下一次复盘。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"family.integrate.covenant-sign","minimum_action":"每人确认听懂。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["JOSH_24_15"],"summary":"公约是可复盘的家庭承诺，不是永久法律。","title":"共同确认并设复盘日"}],"review_status":"theology_review","version":"1.0.0"}'::jsonb,'[{"source":"batch_06/assets/family-attention-practice-catalog.seed.yaml","sha256":"f3f45d737c7086d0bf3469de021c914968937de46e8a0e42dd9aa6e59619d818","generated":false}]'::jsonb,'["theology_reviewer","pastoral_reviewer"]'::jsonb,'skills-bag-01-12'
