y或合法短引。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["ROM_13_7"],"summary":"不缓存或分发未经许可长文本。","title":"经文与材料权利检查"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"THEOLOGY","full_practice":"修正羞耻性目标。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"curriculum.grace-order","minimum_action":"检查开头是否先说明身份和恩典。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["EPH_2_8_10"],"summary":"课程不让实践成为赚取接纳的条件。","title":"恩典先于操练"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"LESSON","full_practice":"删除与目标无关的活动。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"lesson.one-main-idea","minimum_action":"写一句main idea。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["LUKE_10_41_42"],"summary":"减少过载并提高迁移。","title":"一课一个中心思想"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"LESSON","full_practice":"明确解释依据和应用层级。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"lesson.open-observe-apply","minimum_action":"设计一个观察问题。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["ACTS_17_11"],"summary":"先让学习者看见，再给结论。","title":"观察—解释—应用顺序"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"LESSON","full_practice":"预留问题和安全中断时间。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"lesson.activity-budget","minimum_action":"给每段分配分钟。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["LUKE_14_28"],"summary":"总时间、过渡和缓冲必须现实。","title":"活动时间预算"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"LESSON","full_practice":"准备打印或口头替代。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"lesson.minimum-viable","minimum_action":"标记离线核心活动。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PHIL_4_11_13"],"summary":"设备、网络或时间失败时仍能完成核心。","title":"保留最小可完成课"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"TEACHER","full_practice":"加入学习者复述或实践。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"teacher.facilitate-not-perform","minimum_action":"减少一段单向讲述。","review_status":"theology_review","scr