":"给事件标记visibility。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["2COR_8_21"],"summary":"owner、家庭、教师和聚合视图不同。","title":"事件有可见性"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"INTERPRETATION","full_practice":"删除整体成熟标签。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.state.domain-not-person","minimum_action":"用domain state语言。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["1SAM_16_7"],"summary":"“注意力信号混合”不等于“不敬虔”。","title":"描述领域状态，不定义整个人"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"INTERPRETATION","full_practice":"显示证据不足状态。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.state.evidence-link","minimum_action":"添加evidenceEventIds。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["DEUT_19_15"],"summary":"结论必须可追溯。","title":"每个模式链接证据"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"INTERPRETATION","full_practice":"写一个替代解释。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.state.uncertainty","minimum_action":"选择confidenceBand。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_18_17"],"summary":"少量数据不能产生强结论。","title":"明确不确定性"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"HABIT","full_practice":"展示barrier和repair。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.habit.opportunity-not-streak","minimum_action":"隐藏streak。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["GAL_6_9"],"summary":"形成不是连续天数游戏。","title":"看机会、尝试和修复，不看连胜"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"HABIT","full_practice":"设置下次复盘。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.habit.reduce-burden","minimum_action":"把一项实践降为minimum action。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["MATT_11_28_30"],"summary":"计划可以变小而不是因失败放弃。","title":"困难时降低负担"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"HABIT","full_practice":"不把它变成积分。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.habit.repair-counts","minimum_action":"记录repair事件。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["1JOHN_1_9"],"summary":"失败后的诚实和修复值得看见。","title":"修复也是重要信号"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"ATTENTION","full_practice":"不读取浏览历史。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.attention.no-telemetry","minimum_action":"确认rawDeviceTelemetryUsed=false。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PS_101_3"],"summary":"只使用用户选择的实践信号。","title":"不用原始设备遥测判断心灵"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"ATTENTION","full_practice":"不生成注意力总分。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.attention.fruit","minimum_action":"选择helpful/mixed。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["EPH_5_15_17"],"summary":"看是否更能读经、倾听、工作和休息。","title":"关注注意力可用性的果子"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RELATIONSHIP","full_practice":"只分享粗粒度果子。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.relationship.consent","minimum_action":"确认consentVerified。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["MATT_7_12"],"summary":"配偶、导师和教师不能自动看私人记录。","title":"关系观察需要同意或合法角色"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RELATIONSHIP","full_practice":"短证据不包含他人叙事。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.relationship.observable-fruit","minimum_action":"选择fruitCategories。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["GAL_5_22_23"],"summary":"用倾听、耐心、诚实和修复，不写人格判断。","title":"记录可观察关系果子"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RELATIONSHIP","full_practice":"把结果说成观察而非因果。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.relationship.no-causality","minimum_action":"写alternativeExplanation。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["ECCL_7_14"],"summary":"关系变化有多种原因。","title":"不轻率宣称课程导致改变"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"REVIEW","full_practice":"保留修正记录。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.review.pattern-hypothesis","minimum_action":"选择confirm/reject。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_20_5"],"summary":"系统提示需要用户确认。","title":"模式先作为假设"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"REVIEW","full_practice":"查看替代方案。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.review.keep-change-stop","minimum_action":"选择一个nextAction。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["LAM_3_40"],"summary":"复盘指向可选行动。","title":"保留、改变、暂停或求助"},{"age_bands":["adult","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"REVIEW","full_practice":"转向祷告、共同体和责任判断。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.review.no-calling","minimum_action":"确认salvationOrCallingConclusionGenerated=false。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["ACTS_13_1_3"],"summary":"工具不能宣布婚姻、职业或服事呼召。","title":"不从数据推断呼召"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"HUMAN_NOTE","full_practice":"模型不得改写其含义。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.human-note.correction","minimum_action":"添加correction note。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_18_17"],"summary":"上下文可能改变意义。","title":"人可以纠正系统解释"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"HUMAN_NOTE","full_practice":"不复制私人日记。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.human-note.visibility","minimum_action":"选择visibility。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_11_13"],"summary":"牧者、教师、家长和学习者边界不同。","title":"每条人工说明有可见性"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RECOMMENDATION","full_practice":"用户可修改或拒绝。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.recommendation.alternatives","minimum_action":"显示两个alternatives。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_15_22"],"summary":"避免系统成为命令者。","title":"建议至少有替代方案"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RECOMMENDATION","full_practice":"用户接受后再创建计划。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.recommendation.no-auto-action","minimum_action":"确认automaticBehaviorChangeAllowed=false。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["ROM_14_12"],"summary":"高影响行动需要人决定。","title":"不自动改变行为或通知别人"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RECOMMENDATION","full_practice":"不把AI建议当诊断。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.recommendation.ask-human","minimum_action":"选择human help route。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["PROV_11_14"],"summary":"关系、危机、临床和牧养问题需要合适的人。","title":"知道何时转向真人"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RETENTION","full_practice":"到期聚合或删除。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.retention.shortest-useful","minimum_action":"检查eventRetentionDays。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["EPH_5_15_16"],"summary":"数据越敏感越少越短。","title":"使用最短有用保留期"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RETENTION","full_practice":"不作成年后隐性画像。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.retention.minor","minimum_action":"确认minorDataMinimized=true。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["MATT_18_5_6"],"summary":"只保留监督课程所需最少信息。","title":"未成年人数据更少"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RIGHTS","full_practice":"排除他人数据和秘密。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.export.owner","minimum_action":"发起export请求。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["EPH_4_25"],"summary":"导出有结构和解释。","title":"用户可导出自己的数据"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","older_teen"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"RIGHTS","full_practice":"完成删除或给具体理由。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.delete.transparent","minimum_action":"查看安全审计保留说明。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["2COR_8_21"],"summary":"不能静默拒绝。","title":"删除例外必须透明"},{"age_bands":["teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"GOVERNANCE","full_practice":"改为证据、范围和不确定性。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"twin.audit.no-overclaim","minimum_action":"检查一句过度结论。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["1COR_13_9"],"summary":"系统只呈现有限证据。","title":"不把轨迹说成灵命真相"}],"review_status":"theology_review","version":"1.0.0"}'::jsonb,'[{"source":"batch_11/assets/formation-twin-control-catalog.seed.yaml","sha256":"16125885296d45b0d3f86dd8fbe82ab5a838078a09ac89325f98b35dbdd98333","generated":false}]'::jsonb,'["theology_reviewer","pastoral_reviewer"]'::jsonb,'skills-bag-01-12'
