rdrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"cert.content.rights","minimum_action":"核对许可证。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["罗13:7"],"summary":"不得无权分发长篇译文或受保护内容。","title":"版权与译文权利门"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"content_quality","full_practice":"儿童保护与牧养双签。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"cert.content.age","minimum_action":"检查每个ageBand。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["林前14:40"],"summary":"性、色情、创伤和高风险内容必须年龄分级且最小必要。","title":"年龄适切性门"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"skill_evals","full_practice":"覆盖隐式、显式、边缘、负向和冲突路由。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"cert.skill.routing","minimum_action":"运行正负样例。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["箴25:11"],"summary":"既要正确激活，也要避免泛化误触发。","title":"Skill激活与不激活评测"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"skill_evals","full_practice":"保存失败类别、回归样例和发布阻断。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"cert.skill.behavior","minimum_action":"运行核心rubric。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["林前14:33"],"summary":"不能只看最终文本，还要看过程、安全、风格和效率。","title":"Skill过程与输出评测"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"effectiveness","full_practice":"未成年人增加监护同意和适龄assent。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"cert.effectiveness.consent","minimum_action":"显示同意。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["门14"],"summary":"参与评估必须可拒绝、退出且不受属灵惩罚。","title":"效果评估知情同意"},{"age_bands":["adult","parent","teacher"],"authority_level":"PASTORAL_WISDOM","domain":"effectiveness","full_practice":"由心理测量、神学和牧养共同审核。","guardrails":["不得把操练表现转化为救恩、成熟或价值评分"],"id":"cert.effectiveness.construct","minimum_action":"审查指标名。","review_status":"theology_review","scripture_anchors":["撒上16:7"],"summary":"评估可测注意力、可用性和行为，但不得测救恩或灵魂价值。","title":"测量构念边界"},{"age_bands":["adult","p